{"id":"660924","name":"玉米面发糕","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660924/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"150g"},{"name":"白面","amount":"350g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"330g左右"}],"sub":[{"name":"发醇粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"4g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两种面粉混匀，加白糖，泡打粉，发酵粉。","img":"images/660924/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"混匀，加温水和匀。","img":"images/660924/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"和好的面团，盖上保鲜膜温暖处发酵。","img":"images/660924/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"红枣温水泡会。","img":"images/660924/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成小方块。","img":"images/660924/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团发酵至2倍大（约50分钟）。","img":"images/660924/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉匀排气。","img":"images/660924/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用手或擀面仗按压成稍大面团。","img":"images/660924/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放置温水上的帘子上（抹油了已），再次拍压大概成1.5厘米厚度。","img":"images/660924/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆上红枣。","img":"images/660924/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再次醒发至1.5倍大小（约30分钟）。","img":"images/660924/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开火计时30分种关火。焖3分钟开盖。","img":"images/660924/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/660924/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"喧软。","img":"images/660924/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"挺好吃。","img":"images/660924/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}